revolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/wednesday-assorted-links-553.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=wednesday-assorted-links-553">Wednesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/lugaricano/status/2054279208910872595?s=61</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/lugaricano/status/2054279208910872595?s=61</guid><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 16:17:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[comments on Russia]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HILP55caoAApVV1.jpg:large"></p><p>Hanno Lustig (@HannoLustig) on X</p><p>Russian growth miracle? Using Krugman’s logic, Russia is quickly catching up with the US when it comes to living standards. At PPP current prices, Russian GDP per capita is $47,405 (similar to Portugal/Slovenia) and Russia’s per-capita GDP rose from 19.6% to 55.2% of its US</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/HannoLustig/status/2054434119275417875">https://x.com/HannoLustig/status/2054434119275417875</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/wednesday-assorted-links-553.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=wednesday-assorted-links-553">Wednesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/HannoLustig/status/2054434119275417875</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/HannoLustig/status/2054434119275417875</guid><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 16:17:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Speculative claims about quantum batteries?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HIKbMt0bEAAcw1x.jpg:large"></p><p>Owen Lewis (@is_OwenLewis) on X</p><p>Okay folks, this qualifies as BREAKING NEWS! Harold “Sonny” White, the warp drive pioneer behind NASA’s EagleWorks Lab, just stepped out of stealth with Casimir Inc. to unveil MicroSPARC: the first battery free chip to harvest continuous electrical power straight from the</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/is_owenlewis/status/205437502495458141